[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[90mAsking claude to write the rule · 79s\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[31m \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  ---\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  description: Effect code must get its dependencies by yielding services or Effect `Config`, or from its arguments, \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  and must never read them from `process`, `globalThis`, or module scope, nor define a service class inside a \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  function.\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  ---\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  A dependency is anything code needs from its runtime or environment, such as the working directory, environment\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  variables, the platform, the Bun or Node globals, a client, or the file system. When code yields a dependency as a\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  service, the dependency appears in the Effect's requirements type. A Layer then provides it and a test can replace\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  it. Code that reads it from \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mprocess\u001b[39m\u001b[49m or \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mglobalThis\u001b[39m\u001b[49m hides it, and so does code that reads a module-scope value that\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  captured it, such as \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mconst bun = globalThis.Bun\u001b[39m\u001b[49m. The type then says nothing, and nothing can substitute it.\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  This holds in an Effect generator, in a function that returns an Effect, and in a Layer. Use \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mPath.Path\u001b[39m\u001b[49m for paths and\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  the working directory, and \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mConfig.option(Config.Redacted(name))\u001b[39m\u001b[49m or another \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mConfig\u001b[39m\u001b[49m for environment variables. A\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  module-scope constant that holds plain data, such as a table of literal values, is not a dependency.\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  Declare a service class once, at module scope, as \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mclass Name extends Context.Service<...>\u001b[39m\u001b[49m. A function that takes\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  arguments and returns a Layer for that service, such as \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215m(flags: Flags) => Layer.effect(AdhereConfig)(...)\u001b[39m\u001b[49m, is how\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  you configure a service, and it follows this rule. A function that returns a new class, such as\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[38;5;215mconst make = (options) => class Service extends Context.Service<...>\u001b[39m\u001b[49m, breaks it. Each call makes a different service\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  that no Layer or test can name.\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mMust\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m────\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m┌─ \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mts\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[35mexport\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m AdhereConfigLive = (flags: Flags) =>\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  Layer\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.effect\u001b[0m(AdhereConfig)(\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m    Effect\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.gen\u001b[0m(\u001b[0m\u001b[35mfunction\u001b[0m* () {\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m      \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m path = \u001b[0m\u001b[35myield\u001b[0m* Path.Path\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m      \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m cwd = path\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.resolve\u001b[0m()\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m      \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m configFile = \u001b[0m\u001b[35myield\u001b[0m* findConfigFile(cwd)\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m      \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m hasPreset = flags.presets !== \u001b[0m\u001b[33mundefined\u001b[0m && flags.presets.length > \u001b[0m\u001b[33m0\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m    }),\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  )\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m└─\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mNever\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m─────\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m┌─ \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mts\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m load = \u001b[0m\u001b[35myield\u001b[0m* Effect\u001b[0m\u001b[3m\u001b[1m.cached\u001b[0m(\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  attempt(\u001b[0m\u001b[35masync\u001b[0m () => {\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m    \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m bun = (globalThis \u001b[0m\u001b[34mas\u001b[0m { Bun?: { isStandaloneExecutable?: \u001b[0m\u001b[34mboolean\u001b[0m } }).Bun\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m    \u001b[0m\u001b[35mlet\u001b[0m manifest = process.env.ADHERE_TYPESCRIPT_PACKAGE\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m    \u001b[0m\u001b[35mconst\u001b[0m expected = \u001b[0m\u001b[32m`@typescript/typescript-\u001b[0m${process.platform}\u001b[0m\u001b[32m-\u001b[0m${process.arch}\u001b[0m\u001b[32m`\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m  }),\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m│ \u001b[0m)\u001b[0m\u001b[2m;\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m└─\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[90m│\u001b[0m  "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[96m ?\u001b[0m \u001b[1mPush it to darkmatter/standards on the branch adhere/design/declare-effect-dependencies?\u001b[0m \u001b[90m ›\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(Y/n)\u001b[0m"]
[31.832, "o", "\u0007"]
